Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,电影里 德古拉身着斗篷...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the movies, Dracula wears a cape...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:39.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,...某个英国佬靠十字架和圣水打发一天的时间...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and some old English guy always manages to save the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:42.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,...总是在紧要关头化险为夷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at the last minute with crosses and holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道那种电影是鬼扯淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But everybody knows the movies are full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:50.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,事实上他的死对头是刀锋战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is it started with Blade, and it ended with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:53.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们其他人只是凑热闹而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of us were just along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:01:00.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,(叙利亚 沙漠)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:05.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this chicken scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,是楔形文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cuneiform.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,有四千年的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about 4000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:14.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们为什么来这里?  - 因为这里是文明的摇篮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So why here?  - Because this is the cradle of civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:18.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,他应该会喜欢这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have been comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:21.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 丹 看起来又是个死胡同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Dan. This seems like another dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们下面有东西  - 找到手表了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's something beneath us.  - You find a watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是尸体吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a body?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,各位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck? Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:10.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚 艾嘉·文斯 法庭心理医生...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, Dr. Edgar Vance, forensic psychiatrist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:14.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,...纽约时报畅销书作者:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and author of the New York Times bestseller:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:18.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,主题是人类健康之整体突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Whole Being Breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:22.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,同时请到警察局长马丁·维里德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also with us, Martin Vreede, chief of police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:25.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,下个小时将接受观众热线...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be here for the next hour, and they'll be taking your calls...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:29.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,...请观赏班特利现场开讲节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...next on Bentley Tittle Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:36.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 文斯医生 你是心理医生和生化科学家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Dr. Vance, you are a psychiatrist and a biochemist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,...是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...isn't that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 班特利 我两者皆是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, uh, Bentley, I am both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:46.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,只在一个理由之下我坚信 真正的健康的身体...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's for a reason. I have always believed that true health can only be achieved...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:49.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,...只有在身体跟心理的充分调和之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if we reconcile the body and the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:53.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且 为了做到这点 我们还必须排除一些不好的情绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, of course, in order to do that, we have to get rid of a lot of old notions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:57.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 怎么分辨吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, and how does that fit in with vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:05:04.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有关于这个吸血鬼的传说 我们正在研究的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, in the case of vampires, we're dealing with creatures that are the repositories...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:06.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,...对于宗教团体而言他是一种禁忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of some of our most taboo thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 是一种残暴凶狠的性格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay.  - Predatory rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 性虐待狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.  - Sexual sadism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 性冲动?  - 性虐待狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sexual?  - Sexual sadism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:16.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些都潜藏于人的内心深处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are very scary subjects for people to own up to, and they're right inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:20.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 一般人都把这种事 当作借口来推卸责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what you're saying is we pass the buck onto someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说的一点都没错  - 那吸血鬼呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You bet we do.  - And vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 比如 有一种嗜血的血液疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for instance, there's a hereditary blood disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我的书里 我称之为嗜血狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I talk about it in my book, it's called porphyria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.44,0:05:35.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,和疾病的状况很相似 有典型的吸血鬼特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the symptoms of this disease are remarkably similar to classic vampire traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:38.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,一般贫血的人最容易得病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people who suffer from this disease are anemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:43.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们只在夜间活动 他们不能忍受阳光 无法承受大蒜的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They become intolerant to sunlight. They can't handle garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,大蒜? 维里德局长 好吧 您对所有的传闻...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garlic? Chief Vreede, okay, what's your take on all these rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,...近来的吸血鬼传闻你怎么评论? 吸血鬼 吸血鬼到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we've been hearing about vampires? Vampires. Vampires! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:56.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,唯一让我担心的吸血鬼 就是身体检查要抽血 哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only vampires I'm worried about are the ones passing the bar exam. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,咳咳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:03.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,认真说来 如果真有吸血鬼 也还没有发现过他们的踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously though, if vampires existed, don't you think we would've found them by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,严格来说街上也不是那么平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is, our streets have never been safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:10.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,诸如自杀案 凶杀案 各式各样的罪犯充斥于各个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homicides, assaults, violent crime is down across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,民众应该关心的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People wanna be concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:15.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,...那个叫刀锋战士的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they should focus in on characters like this Blade criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想了解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the guy I wanna hear about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想了解刀锋 他是个什么样的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna hear about this character Blade. What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是个精神异常的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a sociopath that we've been pursuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:25.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋他是个麻烦人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade is a troubled individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:27.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他心里认为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that he is under the impression...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:30.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,...世界饱受吸血鬼的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that there is a vast conspiracy of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:31.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh, heh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:36.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须相信 吸血鬼是活在我们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to look at the psychiatric underpinnings of a belief like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:42.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,同时他认为 他自己是个魔鬼的克星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odds are, he believes that he is out there slaying monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好  - 至于他的做法呢...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mm-hm.  - But what he's really doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,...其实他是想消除他自己内心的魔障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is trying to kill aspects of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,《刀锋战士3：三位一体》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在石脊天桥上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on the Stonebridge overpass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:29.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,收到 我往西走 在你下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it. Heading westbound. I'm just beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,跳下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:16.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,(紫外线)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,松开了 拉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him. Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:10.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他有枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪!  - 啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God!  - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被银剑刺中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staked you with silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不会化成灰烬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还是一样笨?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you smarter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是吸血鬼 笨蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a vampire, dumb shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set your sorry ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:14.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:20.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:50.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,噢 刀锋战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚到底是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck happened tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:40.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,太粗心了 刀锋 杀吸血鬼不留痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're getting reckless, Blade. Killing vampires is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:43.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,灰烬不能当证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ash, don't leave any evidence behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:45.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀人可麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing humans is messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,最好没目击者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hope nobody ID'd you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,这东西很好用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This worked really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:58.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么东西?  - 你的新型免疫血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this?  - A new delivery system for your serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,气泡式吸入剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an effervescent inhaler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要咬住罐口 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just bite down on the mouth guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,它会自动送药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delivery's automatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:05.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some friends of mine made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:08.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:11.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你应该记得?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You remember those?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:11.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:14.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,枪战激烈 汽车撞毁...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was horrible. The one car crashed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,...穿长袍的猛开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then the guy in the coat shot the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:18.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 看上去血流成河  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It looked like there was a lot of blood.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:20.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这只是今晚枪战的一小部分...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was just a taste of the mayhem that occurred...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:24.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,...枪战 造成至少四人死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...during tonight's brazen shootout that left at least four people dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:28.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:28.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 一位市民拍下整个过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, apparently, an anonymous citizen captured the whole event on video.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 雷 听说有线索了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ray. Hey, we got a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,赶飞机去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's catch a plane, Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们去逮他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to take these cowboys down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:36.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,猛吃 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck-all. Just feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:15.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经吸干五个人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been through five of them so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,警卫人手够吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we have enough security?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:20.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不是被我们抓来的 他自己送上门来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't capture him, he allowed us to take him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:22.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗? 我要进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand? I'm gonna go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:34.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不该把我唤醒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have woken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:36.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,情非得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:45.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的血 圣餐能解救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your blood, your sacrament, can set us free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:49.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你认为我在乎你们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的族人需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your people need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:51.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,族人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:58.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们只是先祖的行尸走肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing but shadows of your former selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,堕落到如此不堪的地步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how far you have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:03.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,世界改变了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's changed since your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类有了新猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The humans have a new hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:11.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要我去杀他 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'd like me to kill him, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:13.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能抗拒的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't fight the curse
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:18.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能联系医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't call the doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,就那张吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:23.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个我也要.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙该培养点别的兴趣.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,最好不要.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,与渴爱狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the thirsty love guzzler
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:35.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,在黑暗的一面 不要害怕宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the dark side, baby Don't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能抗拒的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't fight the thirst
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,目标往西移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject is heading west.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:44.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 你出名了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. You're famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们被拍个正着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody nailed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,报纸电视到处都是你的面孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your face is all over the papers and television.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,媒体吃尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Media's eating it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:58.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在乎  - 你应该在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like I care.  - Well, you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:01.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀人事件...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like this, taking out a human...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:04.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,...全世界都在乎...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as far as the rest of the world is concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,...你已经成了头号公敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're public enemy number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道有这种人气排行榜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't know this was a popularity contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死 刀锋 你还不知道他们的诡计吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Blade, don't you see what they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们想引起群众对你的公愤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're waging a goddamn P.R. campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:20.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们不只要担心吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's not just vampires we gotta worry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我们还必须跟全世界对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're gonna have to take on the rest of the world too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:28.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你担心太多了 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You worry too much, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,"担心" 我们才能活到今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why we're still alive, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:34.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你出生前我已经在杀吸血鬼 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been doing this since before you were born, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:36.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我把你当儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like a son to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我已经老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I got old on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:42.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,看你孤单一个人被敌人包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you alone, surrounded by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我心里很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法单独打赢这场战争的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't win this war alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:57.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些人 他只给了我一双邪恶眼睛 来吧 这个人怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it. He just gave me the evil eye. Come on, man. What about that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:06.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你好!  - 快点 别胡闹!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prostitute, baby. Whoo-hoo!  - Come on! Quit fucking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:09.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿到想吃人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hungry and I want to eat somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:14.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个怎么样?  - 这个人尝起来一定很像芝多司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about him?  - No fatties. They taste like Cheetos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:17.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:22.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 那是什么? 这个看起来像皱巴巴的苹果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What about that? Shrunken apple-headed bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,无聊 太无聊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fucking sorry ass over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:28.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的给我 男人! 快点选一个吧 上帝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking blow me, man! Just pick one already. Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 得了吧! 得了吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:37.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你们看看那里的美食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, looks like we got ourselves a combo meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,小妞 小妞 小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chickie, chickie, chickie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚餐吃什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:01.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 漂亮的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh, heh. Hey, pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:11.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,不! 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:13.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,会痛要叫啊 辣妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scream if this hurts, chica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈哈!  - 啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha, ha!  - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:25.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,"去死"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Fuck you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,大蒜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garlic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:35.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,会痛要叫啊 帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scream if this hurts, chica.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:45.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:48.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你担心的事发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you were worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:06.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 动作快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:49.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,(数据保护程序启动  1号工作站保护启动)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:47.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,动根手指头你就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move a finger, and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:49.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,动这根可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:51.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,他启动爆炸装置了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got something in his hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:52.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,大家快离开 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:00.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:16.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,里面发生什么事情了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.08,0:26:18.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁可以告诉我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:33.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,站着别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:35.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪 别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot, don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:12.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,(警察局)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:25.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,起床 懒猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise and shine, sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.84,0:27:33.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,FBI探员康柏蓝和哈尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special agents Ray Cumberland, Wilson Hale. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:35.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们盯你很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been tracking you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.40,0:27:37.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.04,0:27:39.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.08,0:27:42.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟你其他受害人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like all your victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:46.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了多少人 刀锋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people have you killed, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:48.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,30? 40? 50人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty? Forty? Fifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.92,0:27:52.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,1182人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1182.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.88,0:27:55.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,但都是他们的爪牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they were all familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,或同伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People who work with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:28:01.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,"他们" 指的是吸血鬼吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. And by "them," you mean vampires, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么杀死他们的 铁汉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how do you kill these bloodsuckers, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:05.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,可不可以告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can give us some pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.84,0:28:07.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 用太阳光吗?  - 是不是用太阳光?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can stake them, right?  - What about sunlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:11.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们不是不能感受阳光吗?  - 怎么办? 他们还工作吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They ain't feeling sunlight right?  - What about crosses? Do they still work?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:13.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 在这个时代?  - 我不知道 雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In this day and age?  - I don't know, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.28,0:28:15.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些吸血鬼是不是都是犹太人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Mr. Homey Vampire's like Jewish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.04,0:28:19.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈 这才是重点  - 嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha. That's a good point.  - Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:22.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,大蒜怎么样? 这个好像对吸血鬼才有效?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about garlic? Does that work on Hindu vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.60,0:28:24.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是说用大便治病?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do you need like saffron or some shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 说得好  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was quick.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:36.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你继续自欺欺人吧 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can keep doing your song and dance as long as you want, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.56,0:28:38.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是不会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not gonna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.48,0:28:40.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:42.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是个冷血杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a stone-cold killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.48,0:28:44.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且变态 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're sick as fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.40,0:28:46.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他交给专家诊断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's leave the diagnosis to the professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:49.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:51.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是文斯医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Dr. Vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.64,0:28:55.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我负责对你做心理评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been charged with giving you a psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.32,0:28:59.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,两位 可以回避一下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, would you mind giving us just a couple of minutes alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.40,0:29:01.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.36,0:29:18.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你心里很害怕...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you must find this very frightening...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:22.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,...但请相信我是来帮助你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I want you to know that I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.68,0:29:25.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了让我能够帮助你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in order for me to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:27.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我得先问你几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm gonna have to ask you a couple of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.64,0:29:30.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.24,0:29:36.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 刀锋 你在里面被关了几天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh. You know, Blade, the darnedest thing. I was signing in at Security...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:39.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,...你可能不知道今天是几号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and couldn't remember the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.84,0:29:42.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,请问今天是几号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what day it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:48.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,总统是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the president?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.76,0:29:51.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他在哪里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.88,0:29:53.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁是白宫主人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's in the White House right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.72,0:29:55.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个痞子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:02.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以跟我谈谈吸血鬼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think somebody here wants to talk about vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.60,0:30:06.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:11.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个问题有点笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For everyone else, it's kind of silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:16.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个蜡像做的吸血鬼已经七年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a set of wax teeth when I was 7 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.92,0:30:20.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.60,0:30:23.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我做个旁观者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.56,0:30:27.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,倒是想听听你说吸血鬼的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wanna hear you talk about vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.00,0:30:30.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以对我说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you tell me about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.92,0:30:34.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.08,0:30:37.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也是其中之一吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.92,0:30:45.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,有时候他们只是吓到而已...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes the scariest monster of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:47.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,...被一面镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the one in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.72,0:30:54.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我关于嗜血的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.00,0:30:56.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,血的滋味怎么样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you drink blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:59.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,...吸血时你会性亢奋吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...do you ever feel sexually aroused?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.28,0:31:08.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得吸血行为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just strikes me that this business of vampirism...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:14.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,...跟性错乱有强烈关连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has a very strong element of sexual confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.16,0:31:18.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,算是一种交换体液行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuzzling into someone's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:21.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,夜间到访...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nocturnal visit...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.16,0:31:27.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,...是一种肉体上甜美的幻想症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with promises of delicious physical intimacy.\
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,非常甜美的口水...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very sweet taste of saliva...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.20,0:31:36.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,...和皮肤融合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...mixed with skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.16,0:31:40.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:43.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是从哪里来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where's it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:45.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:51.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 你跟你母亲的关系怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm starting to wonder what your relationship with your mother was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:56.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们很亲密吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were the two of you very close?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是神经病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.48,0:32:07.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 错不了  - 为大家好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No shit.  - For his safety and for the public's...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:09.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,...他应该送神经病院…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'm recommending he be transferred to County Psychiatric...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:11.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的! 他是我的犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck that! That man is my prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.88,0:32:14.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是与很多罪案有关的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wanted in connection with a laundry list of crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,等一等 先生们 他现在在我的辖区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, gentlemen. We're in my jurisdiction now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:18.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,有意见请跟地方法官申诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a problem with that, you talk to the local magistrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:21.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,那个人是我的犯人! 别他妈的干涉我的事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That man is my prisoner! Don't fuck with my thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.08,0:32:24.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,院方会派一组人来接他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a team from the hospital effecting the transfer immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.08,0:32:27.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该跟我们合作才对 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be working with us, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:28.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,这次不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:37.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,这东西会让你乖乖合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just a little something to keep you compliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.28,0:32:42.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,一般人只要200到300毫克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The usual dose for this sort of thing is 200, 300 milligrams...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:47.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,...但像你这种人高马大的杂种...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I think with a big, strapping hybrid like yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.68,0:32:50.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,...剂量应该提高到2000毫克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'll kick it up to a couple thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.32,0:32:52.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不怕打针吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have a problem with needles, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:56.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:32:57.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不怎么痛 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't so bad, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.20,0:33:02.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你好虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.84,0:33:04.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,需要血清是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In need of your serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.84,0:33:07.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉一定很不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.84,0:33:11.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 很难想像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, who would've imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.52,0:33:14.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我这种凡夫俗子竟比你强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that a mere human like me could have overpowered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.28,0:33:19.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他们是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.68,0:33:22.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.24,0:33:28.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,加入已经五年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going on five years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.08,0:33:34.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,时机快成熟了 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the endgame, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.72,0:33:37.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的计划到了成熟阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All their plans are coming to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:41.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不妨放轻松 看好戏上场?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just sit back and enjoy the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.20,0:33:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恨吸血帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:05.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们还活着 妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why we're still alive, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.72,0:34:07.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我把你当自己的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like a son to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:14.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I got old on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:20.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,看到你孤单一人被敌人包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you alone, surrounded by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.28,0:34:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我心里很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.52,0:34:49.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.84,0:34:51.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴又见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So glad to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.72,0:34:53.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很崇拜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am such a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.88,0:34:56.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的刺青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:34:59.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,它们有特殊意义吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do they mean anything
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.64,0:35:01.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,猪头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:04.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:05.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,累吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.00,0:35:09.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,虚弱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:16.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类被我们骗得团团转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We moved the humans around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.12,0:35:18.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,像棋盘上的卒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:21.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们利用他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used them...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:23.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,...将你变成过街老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to flush you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.04,0:35:34.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你并不高大嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.56,0:35:38.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,孤苦无依啊 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all alone, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.48,0:35:41.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在没有人会来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's gonna help you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:01.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,(操 你)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.84,0:36:05.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 小姐们  - 汉尼拔·金恩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evening, ladies.  - Hannibal King!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.28,0:36:10.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,起来 我们救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up. This is your rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:00.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.92,0:37:49.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:04.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.72,0:38:07.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,往这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.64,0:38:18.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋 你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.64,0:38:20.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.68,0:38:28.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:37.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 哇 哇 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey. Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.68,0:38:40.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里? 他要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going? Where the fuck is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.56,0:38:42.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来救他的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is supposed to be a rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.00,0:38:50.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,回来 回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:55.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们被困住了  - 在角落没办法开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're pinned down.  - I can't shoot around corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:57.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.08,0:40:02.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这下完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:03.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.36,0:40:19.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了我的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgot my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.92,0:40:25.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们是士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are soldiers, after all
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.20,0:40:27.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们不会丢掉荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down by honor we won't fall. After all
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.00,0:40:29.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,喔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.52,0:40:30.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.16,0:40:32.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comin'out the back end
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.36,0:40:34.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,在你死之前 他引导你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead at you. He throwin'that hot lead at you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.88,0:40:37.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,鼓动下属 喝XO 金属吸气剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swang affiliate, XO sip, a gold getter
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.52,0:40:39.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他人在一起 我是一个冷酷杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the rest together. I'm a cold killer
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.52,0:40:41.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是"我反对的世界"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's "Me Against the World" like 2Pac
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.80,0:40:44.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,像你听到的:"我准备好去死"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like Biggie. I'm "Ready to Die" for what you got
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.56,0:40:45.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱碧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.76,0:40:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,盯上他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.08,0:40:55.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.80,0:40:57.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们是什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.64,0:41:00.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫汉尼拔·金恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my name is Hannibal King.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.48,0:41:02.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个女豪杰叫爱碧嘉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this little hellion right here is Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.32,0:41:04.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:19.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为惠斯勒家被满门抄斩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the vampires killed Whistler's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.08,0:41:23.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错 但我是非婚生子女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did. I was born later out of wedlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.64,0:41:29.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,成年后 才找到老爸认祖归宗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came of age, I tracked my dad down, and I told him I wanted in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.76,0:41:31.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,从此与吸血鬼誓不两立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been doing it ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.68,0:41:40.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蜂巢之家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the honeycomb hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.84,0:41:43.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你哪来的经费?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you bankroll this operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.92,0:41:45.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,陪有钱老头睡觉啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I date a lot of older men.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.76,0:41:48.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我是开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:50.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,这位是德克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You met Dex.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.64,0:41:51.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是海吉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.04,0:41:54.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,桑莫菲 新吸入式血清发明人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sommerfield. She's the one who built that new serum inhaler of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.16,0:41:59.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚那位女孩是她女儿柔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That runt you saw earlier, that was Sommerfield's daughter. Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.76,0:42:03.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们自称夜行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call ourselves the Nightstalkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.68,0:42:08.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像过气的卡通人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. Sounds like rejects from a Saturday morning cartoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.24,0:42:11.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,本想叫夜魔侠 但有人先用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were gonna go with the Care Bears, but that was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.52,0:42:17.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里总共有多少人?  - 够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many of you are there?  - There's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.04,0:42:19.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们采用暗桩作业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We operate in sleeper cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.80,0:42:22.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个倒下 马上有人递补\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When one goes down, another cell activates to pick up the slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.64,0:42:24.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是你的生力军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider us your reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.32,0:42:28.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你们这些业余的能帮助我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you amateurs are supposed to be helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.40,0:42:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.48,0:42:34.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看你们的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.96,0:42:36.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们太嫩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:38.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么上大场面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not ready to roll with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.20,0:42:41.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,看你们的打扮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at the way you're dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.16,0:42:43.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这也算一种战术吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, that's supposed to be tactical?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.80,0:42:48.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么? 干死你! 想笑死人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? What is that? Fuck you! It's a joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.28,0:42:52.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼? 你们以为好玩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is wrong with y'all? Y'all think this is a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.60,0:42:57.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们以为是搞笑剧吗?  - 好的 第一 你这态度很失礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think this is a fucking sitcom?  - Okay, first off, that's just rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.52,0:43:01.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,第二 我们刚刚救了你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second, I'm pretty sure we saved your ass back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.44,0:43:05.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.76,0:43:08.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋 我父亲交代要我们帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Blade, my father meant for us to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.96,0:43:11.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,不满意也只好接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it or not, we are all you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.44,0:43:15.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道如何猎杀吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell makes you think you know about hunting vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.32,0:43:18.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个最简单的道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.76,0:43:21.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以前是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.52,0:43:23.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,面试可以通过了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I pass the audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.80,0:43:27.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,菜鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.00,0:43:30.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的汉尼拔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking Hannibal King!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:34.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,当初我应该把他撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've ripped his bleeding heart out when I had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.92,0:43:43.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.84,0:43:45.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们抓到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.12,0:43:49.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要幸灾乐祸的样子 艾许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't tell me "I told you so," Asher.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.16,0:43:51.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么是错? 你该休息了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, half-pint? You need a timeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.16,0:43:53.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,你算老几\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.72,0:43:56.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这次输得有够难看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got caught with our pants down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.04,0:43:58.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,难看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pants down?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.48,0:44:01.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,简直是被强暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They pretty much fucking ass-raped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:02.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.24,0:44:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,他知道了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he been told?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.56,0:44:07.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道你们一败涂地?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About your failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.60,0:44:09.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.56,0:44:13.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来我得亲自出马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time I joined the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.64,0:44:23.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道哪种女人最危险?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the kind of woman that just screams trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:27.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一看就知道她招惹不得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see her, and every warning bell in your brain starts going off...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.88,0:44:31.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,...但你忍不住还是跟她要电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you still manage to ask for her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.96,0:44:33.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,碰到这种女人我就缴械了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's all I ever hook up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.04,0:44:35.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这女人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this betty...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.00,0:44:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,...天下没一个女人是她的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whoa, she blew them all away in the shitstorm sweepstakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.52,0:44:43.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,她叫丹妮卡·泰勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name is Danica Talos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.40,0:44:44.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以前见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You met her earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.00,0:44:48.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,她与众不同 撩牙长在阴道里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unlike typical vampires, her fangs are located in her vagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.28,0:44:52.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.96,0:44:55.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,她左边那个是她哥哥 艾许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man on her left is her brother, Asher.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.96,0:44:59.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个是加科·格日伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this walking diaper stain is Jarko Grimwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.56,0:45:01.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在酒吧钓上她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I picked Danica up in a bar...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:03.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,...在一起五年...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and spent the next five years playing hide-and-go-suck...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.00,0:45:05.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,...从头到尾当她的性奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as her little vampire cabana boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.12,0:45:08.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后爱碧嘉找到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually, Abigail found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.72,0:45:12.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,病治好了我成了吸血鬼杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sommerfield managed to treat me with a cure, and now I kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.88,0:45:16.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我算是彻底脱胎换骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's basically turning a frown upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.56,0:45:20.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须集合所有资源 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to pool our resources, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.64,0:45:22.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,"我们"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.84,0:45:26.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.96,0:45:28.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他重现江湖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.36,0:45:32.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.00,0:45:39.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,漫画你也当真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.84,0:45:49.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们从哪里找到这些东西?  - 大部分是偷来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you guys get this stuff?  - I stole most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.20,0:45:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是从地下挖出来的一些珍藏 这是他的一件盔甲 石器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danica had a huge collection. He had stone work...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.20,0:45:56.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,...铁器 艺术品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...iron work, weaponry, art.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.24,0:46:00.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,有图像有雕刻通通都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stuff that shows up everywhere, this symbol, this glyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.08,0:46:03.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,它的东西都在这 这些都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on everything in here. He is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.00,0:46:07.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你挖掘的所有神话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dig beneath all the myths, all the layers of bullshit...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.52,0:46:09.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,...五百年前谜样的文化遗物...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that have cluttered our culture for the last 500 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.00,0:46:12.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,...这些几乎都是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and eventually, you're gonna strike the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.40,0:46:14.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以电影是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the movies are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.12,0:46:19.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,不止是电影 漫画 童话故事都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The movies are just a comforting fairytale compared to the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:21.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,他写了一个好故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bram Stoker, he wrote a good yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:27.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,1897年我们才发现他 摩西那个时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the events he described back in 1897... God, that was just a tiny piece of the mosaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.24,0:46:32.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是他应该存在于更早更早之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real Dracula, his origins, date back much, much earlier then that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:36.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 多早?  - 根据七百年前的遗迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How early?  - Try 6 or 7 thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.36,0:46:38.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a piece of his armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.96,0:46:42.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,有了它 我们根据它勾勒出他的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With it, we were able to extrapolate a basic idea of what this fucker looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.56,0:46:43.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你再看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.56,0:46:46.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,德古拉只是他的化名之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dracula's only one of the names he's gone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.24,0:46:51.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,巴比伦人把他当阎罗王 现在称他为德瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Babylonians worshipped him as Dagon, and now they call him Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.60,0:46:54.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,根据传说他生于古叙利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believe in the legends, he was born in ancient Sumeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:07.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道他源自哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody really knows the specifics of his origin, but we do know this:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.44,0:47:12.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,只知道他是吸血鬼的始祖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the first of his kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.92,0:47:17.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,夜行人种的大长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The patriarch of Hominus nocturna.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:25.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,天生完美无暇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was born perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.44,0:47:33.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟大白鳖一样 完全不需要进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just like the great white shark, this guy has never had to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.92,0:47:35.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,别被书或电影的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget the movies, forget the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.68,0:47:37.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,快乐结局骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no happy ending with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.96,0:47:42.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,直到今天他还在暗处活动...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been there, moving behind the scenes...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.24,0:47:46.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,...从远古杀出一条血路活到今天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...cutting a bloody fucking path through the ages, until suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.08,0:47:50.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,...从未停歇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.96,0:47:56.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,...神出鬼没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he up and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.36,0:47:57.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们听到一个谣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we heard a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.08,0:48:00.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼前段时间正找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vampires were searching for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.32,0:48:02.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,有人说他已沉睡几百年...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some say he'd been sleeping through the ages...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.84,0:48:05.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,...退出了这个仇恨他的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that he'd retreated from a world he'd become disgusted with.\
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.00,0:48:10.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,半年前他在伊拉克被找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And according to our information, they found him in 1raq about six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.28,0:48:11.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他非常生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.20,0:49:11.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的橱窗里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the window....
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.52,0:49:13.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,有卖吸血鬼商品?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sell vampire merchandise?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.56,0:49:18.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 看看嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.00,0:49:20.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们东西不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might have a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.56,0:49:25.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,有德古拉便当盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got Dracula lunchboxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.32,0:49:26.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see those?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.76,0:49:30.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,大头娃娃 钥匙圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's bobbleheads, key chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:32.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,这多有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is funny
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.44,0:49:39.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,大蒜每次都提醒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The garlic gets me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.08,0:49:42.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,应有尽有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.88,0:49:45.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有吸血鬼按摩棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even vampire vibrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.32,0:49:50.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.80,0:49:56.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,"德古拉伯爵" 让你想哭 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dracola." Makes you wanna cry, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在找什么东西吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there something special you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:10.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.52,0:50:12.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,她在跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.40,0:50:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,想吻我吗 帅哥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna kiss me, pretty boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.96,0:50:28.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,不想!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.04,0:50:59.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么吵醒德古拉?  - 我们正想搞懂这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why wake up Drake now?  - That's what we've been trying to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.32,0:51:00.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还是吸血鬼时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was under the fang...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.72,0:51:04.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,...听他们说要找什么终极方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there used to be talk about some kind of vampire final solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.80,0:51:07.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,但没道理毁掉食物来源啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never figured out why they'd wanna destroy their food source.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:08.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,这毫无意义 对不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes no sense, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.84,0:51:10.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不断想办法对付人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've always had plans for the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.92,0:51:13.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来 不管他们在做...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems likely that whatever they're cooking up...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:15.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,...德古拉复出也是其中之一 面对事实...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Drake's return is part of it. Let's face it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.04,0:51:17.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,...这场战争胜算不大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we are fighting a losing battle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.20,0:51:20.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,一年了不起杀他们几百个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we kill a few hundred of them a year. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.84,0:51:23.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他们数量高达数万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are thousands of them out there, maybe tens of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.88,0:51:24.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须要有新战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a new tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:26.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,比如说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.40,0:51:27.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,生物武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A biological weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.56,0:51:30.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,针对你们看得见的人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you sighted people...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.68,0:51:35.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,...这里有一段说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...here's a little show-and-tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.88,0:51:38.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从事合成DNA...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last year, I've been working with synthesized DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.68,0:51:42.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,...多年来创造出一种人造吸血鬼病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in order to create an artificial virus targeted specifically at vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:44.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们称之为"晨星"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're calling it DayStar.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.72,0:51:46.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想想看 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.96,0:51:49.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以将他们一举歼灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could wipe them all out in one single move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.64,0:51:51.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么不采取行动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's been holding you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.40,0:51:53.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,但致命率不能达到百分之百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lethality in vampires is still spotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.80,0:51:56.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一股更强的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bottom line is, we need a better strand of DNA to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.80,0:51:59.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要德古拉的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need Dracula's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.96,0:52:02.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为德古拉具有吸血鬼的血源...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Dracula is the progenitor of the vampire race...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.60,0:52:04.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,...他的DNA最纯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his DNA is still pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.08,0:52:09.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,未曾经过数百世代变种的稀释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hasn't been diluted by a hundred generations of selective mutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.80,0:52:15.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,有了他的血"晨星"的效力可以达到百分百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get his blood, we can boost DayStar's viral efficacy to 100 percect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.68,0:52:17.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼将全部灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the vampires go bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你想不想成为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can we just go right ahead and sign you up...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.04,0:52:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我们的夜行者的荣誉会员?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for one of our secret Nightstalker decoder rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.16,0:52:31.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 嗯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.08,0:52:35.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼了... 各位帅哥辣妹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. Urn.... Gentlemen and hottie...
