Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.52,0:52:44.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,各种口径大小的电子枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electronic pistol. Comes in a variety of tasty calibers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.20,0:52:46.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸性子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explosive rounds.
