Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.04,0:52:52.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我称之为日之犬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call them sundogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.84,0:52:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,海吉斯 秀点特别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hedges. Super Size me, sweetheart.
