Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.84,0:53:29.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 海吉斯 以下我来说明  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hedges, I'll take it from here.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.36,0:53:32.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,它的威力大概等于半个太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bad boy is half as hot as the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:36.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀吸血鬼像切奶油一样轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can cut through vampires like a knife through butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.60,0:53:39.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,但德古拉的本事得仔细评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still trying to sort out fact from fiction when it comes to Dracula.
