Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.56,0:53:49.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是变成蝙蝠或狼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not into a bat or a wolf or anything like that...
