Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.16,0:54:03.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,这点我有问题 海吉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a... I have a question about that, Hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.68,0:54:05.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是处男吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever been laid?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.28,0:54:07.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我经验丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.08,0:54:09.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟女人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.16,0:54:12.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,该给他们一点压力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for a little refresher.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.40,0:54:15.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼统御上最脆弱的一环...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weakest link in the vampire chain of command...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.20,0:54:18.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,...就是他们帮内的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has always been their familiars.
