Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.44,0:54:43.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,她打猎时喜欢听MP3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes to listen to MP3s when she hunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.60,0:54:45.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,当成她的个人配乐 你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like her own internal soundtrack, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.08,0:54:49.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,全都是现在孩子们最爱听的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark-core, trip hop, whatever kids are listening to these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:53.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我是大卫·哈斯霍夫的影迷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, I'm more of a David Hasselhoff fan, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.24,0:55:51.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的头迟早会被甩掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually, you know, your head is gonna pop off.
