Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:58.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我发誓 我发誓!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know my fucking handler. I swear. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.00,0:56:01.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 该死 求求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit! Please! Please! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.92,0:56:07.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.20,0:56:09.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.12,0:56:12.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 给我 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go. Come on.
