Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.72,0:56:23.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我是文斯医生 你找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, this is Dr. Vance. You paged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.40,0:56:24.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.56,0:56:27.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,找你的 接啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for you. Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.72,0:56:28.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,那位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.88,0:56:30.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.56,0:56:34.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 人有时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, at some point, you, uh...
