Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.84,0:56:38.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你懂得 分享一下心里的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? Have a little share time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:42.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,碰触一下内心那份纯真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick back. Get in touch with your inner child. That sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.40,0:56:46.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,建议你 偶尔要眨一下眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, just a thought, but you might wanna consider blinking once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:55.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我今天吃太多糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I uh... l ate a lot of sugar today.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.04,0:57:14.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.32,0:57:16.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,闲人不能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just can't walk in here like that. Unh!
