Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.84,0:57:54.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 文斯呢?  - 很抱歉 文斯医生现在没空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Vance?  - I'm sorry, you can't see Dr. Vance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.12,0:58:05.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.20,0:58:11.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,有事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I, uh... Can I help you?
