Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.80,0:58:16.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 文斯 你知道些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Vance, what the hell do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.76,0:58:21.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.24,0:58:22.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱碧 他是德瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abby, it's Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.52,0:58:41.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就是他们害怕的猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're the hunter they all fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.28,0:58:44.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 难怪我有感觉  - 尽管开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had a feeling about you.  - Just shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.24,0:58:45.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,开啊 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.80,0:58:46.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看你有没有种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.84,1:00:19.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.20,1:00:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他抓走我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got my baby! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.60,1:00:25.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! My baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.72,1:01:26.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心 日行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Careful, Daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.00,1:01:28.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been told about you...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.08,1:01:30.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,...同情人类的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your weakness for humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:32.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么杀文斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you kill Vance?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.80,1:01:34.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,他已经没利用价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd outlived his purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.16,1:01:36.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,他死得其所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died a good death.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.04,1:01:38.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,干净 快速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.84,1:01:40.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你懂什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.80,1:01:42.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.
