Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没看过史托克的小说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you read Stoker's fable?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:52.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是吸血鬼的始祖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the first of the vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.16,1:01:55.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是独一无二的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:58.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以他们找你帮忙  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So that's why they brought you back.  - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.04,1:02:02.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的血可以让他们成为日行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They believe through me they could become Daywalkers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.56,1:02:08.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,看那些忙碌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.24,1:02:11.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,像小虫子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurrying around like insects.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.60,1:02:16.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不懂战士的荣誉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know anything about honor or living by the sword...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.36,1:02:17.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,...不像你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not like you and I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.48,1:02:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能懂何谓不朽吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think they could ever grasp what it means to be immortal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.12,1:02:23.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是不朽的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.12,1:02:27.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,几百个吸血鬼讲过相同的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have heard hundreds of you rodents make the same claim.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.40,1:02:31.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,但都尝到我剑的滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each one of them have tasted the end of my sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.40,1:02:33.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许我会是下一个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I will too, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.44,1:02:36.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,...但相信下次我们见面...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I think it is more likely, the next time we meet...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.12,1:02:39.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,...你会倒在我面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you fall before mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.28,1:02:41.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,接住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.32,1:03:01.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cootchie-coo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.72,1:03:06.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有看到他吗? 我们输定了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that guy? We're gonna lose, man. We're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.60,1:03:08.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! God!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.92,1:03:10.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会死得很难看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna fucking lose!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.88,1:03:12.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay.  - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.48,1:03:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么 你跟其他的吸血鬼一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did the one lesbian vampire say to the other?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.56,1:03:20.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 金恩  - 二十天一次 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up, King.  - See you in 28 days. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.80,1:03:23.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇 等等 那是什么? 你想干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hold on. What... What is that? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.80,1:03:26.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,弹性蛋白 帮你止血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an elastic protein, okay? It's gonna stop the hemorrhaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.88,1:03:29.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 会痛吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Is it gonna hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.28,1:03:30.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,一点点刺痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's gonna sting a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:32.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Unh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.88,1:03:38.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.04,1:03:43.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a family once.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.56,1:03:46.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,夫妻俩 两个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wife, two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.28,1:03:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,那一晚来了一个流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then a drifter came calling one evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:03:56.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.80,1:04:00.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他先戏弄他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He toyed with them first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.00,1:04:05.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,要我决定谁先死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tried to make me decide which order they'd die in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.28,1:04:09.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我猎杀吸血鬼很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been doing this a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.52,1:04:11.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,从你出生前已经开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.92,1:04:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你过这种生活 爱碧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want this life for you, Abby.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.16,1:04:59.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.56,1:05:02.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有个问题想问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.32,1:05:04.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀光所有吸血鬼后你想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say we're successful. Say we wipe out all the vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.00,1:05:06.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.24,1:05:08.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想过这问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever ask yourself that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.28,1:05:16.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,很难想像你在社区里教空手道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, somehow, I don't picture you teaching karate at the local Y.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.52,1:05:28.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他讨厌我 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hates me, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.20,1:05:30.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.20,1:05:43.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么带着那个东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you wear that symbol?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.40,1:05:49.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,老习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old habits.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.00,1:05:54.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以前是天主教学校的女学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a good Catholic school girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.88,1:05:59.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我曾经是  - 我那个时候在对抗他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Once.  - l was there when they crucified him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.60,1:06:04.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,他因赎罪而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died for their sins.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.60,1:06:06.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的罪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.04,1:06:10.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你的罪恶呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are your sins?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.84,1:06:15.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在乎吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you care to confess them?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.92,1:06:21.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.08,1:06:24.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.40,1:06:27.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will make you a better one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.00,1:06:55.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,有个古老传说:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an old saying:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.44,1:07:01.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,"杀死了国王 侮辱了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Kill one man, you're a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.40,1:07:05.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill a million, a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.64,1:07:09.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀光他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them all...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.40,1:07:11.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,...上帝"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a God."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.72,1:07:38.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要吸这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.84,1:07:44.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我体内有个坏东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there's something bad inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.60,1:07:47.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,这可以防止它跑出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This keeps it from getting out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.72,1:07:49.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不能当好人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't you just be nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.40,1:07:57.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为世界对我不友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the world isn't nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.48,1:08:04.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道吸血鬼躲在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found where the vampires are working.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.32,1:08:07.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,生化医药企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biomedica Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.64,1:08:10.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们在大肆采购补给品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been buying up all sorts of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.52,1:08:11.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,查查看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.00,1:08:14.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,DNA聚合酵素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taq polymerase.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:17.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,骨髓成长素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bone-marrow growth supplement.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.76,1:08:20.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,基因排序酵素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genetic-sequencing enzymes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.80,1:08:23.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 要派对纪念品吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hm.  - You want a party favor?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.04,1:08:26.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,幸运7号 银子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky seven. Silver hollow points.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.88,1:08:28.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.84,1:08:59.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你找我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.00,1:09:01.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.92,1:09:04.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚上兼差打工吗 老大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doing a little moonlighting, chief?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.36,1:09:05.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.40,1:09:18.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.48,1:09:21.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.16,1:09:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.96,1:09:28.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spill it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.40,1:09:29.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你心里明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.32,1:09:31.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,里面是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.52,1:09:42.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,1号门里面是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what's behind door number one?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.24,1:09:46.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能说 他们会杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you. They... They'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.44,1:09:48.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀你? 王八蛋 我更想杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill you? Motherfucker, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.60,1:09:50.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just enjoy it better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.44,1:09:59.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.88,1:10:17.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.32,1:10:22.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.32,1:10:39.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.00,1:10:42.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,鲜血畜牧场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a blood-farming facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.12,1:10:53.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们觉得一个个猎杀效率...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires decided that hunting humans on a piecemeal basis was...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:54.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,...太低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...too inefficient.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.68,1:10:58.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,猎物能养活不一定要杀掉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why kill your prey when you can keep them alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.84,1:11:03.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,在最佳状况下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under optimal conditions, a donor can generate...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.12,1:11:06.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,...一个可以生产50到100品脱的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...anywhere from 50 to 100 pints of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.32,1:11:08.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,生产力很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Productive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:12.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些人哪来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you get all these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.96,1:11:16.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,每个大城市都有物流中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got processing centers in every major city.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.92,1:11:18.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,美国随时都有两三百万...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At any given time, there's what...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.20,1:11:22.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,...无家可归的游民?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...2, 3 million homeless wandering around America?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.00,1:11:24.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们直接在街上抓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just pull them in off the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.84,1:11:28.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,有谁在乎他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody cares about them.
