Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.40,1:41:08.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,去大厅找找看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you tried the lobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.72,1:41:11.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.80,1:41:18.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.12,1:41:21.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 金恩  - ...这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, King.  - ...this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.20,1:41:40.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.72,1:41:43.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备受死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.12,1:41:48.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,一出生就准备好了 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born ready, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.04,1:41:52.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,"混蛋"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Motherfucker."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.68,1:41:54.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,这名字不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.72,1:43:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的手臂断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broke my arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.04,1:47:31.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,想死了吗 混蛋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to die, motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.40,1:49:03.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,别管它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.88,1:49:05.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,起来 快起来啊 金恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give it up, King.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.88,1:49:08.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,起来吧 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it up. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.24,1:49:09.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.48,1:49:37.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,挺住 亲爱的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang in there, kitten.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.00,1:49:39.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找人救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get help.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.80,1:49:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好笑 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.40,1:49:56.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我族人一直想创造新吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this time, my people were trying to create a new kind of vampire...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.20,1:49:59.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,...你不正是最好的品种吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when one already existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.60,1:50:03.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.44,1:50:06.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我们族人的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future of our race rests with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.04,1:50:09.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你跟恐惧对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fought with honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.04,1:50:11.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我尊敬你这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.16,1:50:15.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我送你一个临别礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me a parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.56,1:50:18.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But remember this:
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.96,1:50:22.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,迟早有一天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.28,1:50:25.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,...嗜血欲望会战胜一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the thirst always wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.20,1:53:26.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Blade?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.60,1:53:29.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,病毒并没有杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The virus didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.84,1:53:32.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是一个混血儿 他的心从来不会停止跳动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he was a hybrid, his heart never stopped beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.68,1:53:34.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,只可能减慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It simply slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.68,1:53:39.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以他沉睡了 为了重生的一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so he slept, waiting for the moment he could walk the earth again.
